<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian authorities arrested a former regime officer accused of orchestrating a 2014 massacre near Damascus and an ex-general linked to the same ambush, while a commander from the Al-Assad era was detained for involvement in the Al-Otaiba ambush. Security forces also seized a drug dealer in eastern Deir Ezzor and investigated suspected sabotage of a gas pipeline in the same region. A landmine blast injured three people in Aleppo, and Saudi and Syrian foreign ministers met to discuss regional security cooperation. The conflict produced 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxPSk8xVmE5MEZ5WldQdXhBYWZvODdGZEpWNTM1a0I5QUVpTHdUd2hLZHU4aDRwR0NhMng4bDZBYjhoejFmYVdXVEVLYU94WEZwZ1NxNjdMZlNTUWtLUWpvMUN4a0liZi1DRUhHMkVhQ2t1RjZwQzJIRE44dGFabDQ2dWFWam1XUjdpdjBxY19Wa2ppTjNuSFNJNjliV1pHVXVtbWV0ODl1OUNGa0NHV296M3J4UkpvS0VFYno0TmZVdlo?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPd0k4MkFvZUNzUmQ3SFlLTC1wU3JtU1FpWWl0a0V1RDVwRjJ1b2I2Yl9JT1lxclhPOEJ0QnBLTDJrY013T3REUDNtd1FxRlhjMFp3alJlNV9aVHo2T2Q0U1ljRHVMOVdKWHdpb05LU3pqVk1IeUxGeFJrNG5ZaVJIQ2E0Um00RWZNWl9TemVxSzgtWjcyb1Z5VWZ6T3pHcENnZ2t5TlI0XzF0T1JOc3RFRTU3dk9TdlEz0gG-AUFVX3lxTE82MEhKTi1BUVBaaG9NRkFHeGdoYk9ObDFzaDkxclhWZ0QyaHZIY3NkVjJkMEVwUUtQci1KUjRYTjkydjBQTV9LYlRmcXdnZEVqSnowMVg3NjFPUkloLVRtMzRjZEFOVlhCUmJvTXBDWU5XcGtBMEtHR2xRbG44OXZZdWlGdkF3d0YxZlFQLWUyTnBTalJzc1FwUVEzQXp1OVNJbWtMOXJLVnNheDdvcUdReUhNakxiOVJlN201UFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE9ydE5xZ1g5SV9vbnY4dzc1bmxkSWVEUFBTdWFZRkN1RUhFWXJUUENIb09OYnpYc0dOOVFlMGpQMEg0YzV4bVdPNg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https: